.Dd November 2, 2026
.Dt AKTURE.CONF 5
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm akture.conf
.Nd configuration of the akture display manager
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is read by
.Xr akture 8
at startup.
Each line has the form
.Dl key = value
Blank lines are ignored.
Only lines whose first non-blank character is
.Ql #
are comments; a
.Ql #
later in a line belongs to the value, as in colours.
Unknown keys and invalid values are logged and the default is used.
.Pp
The keys are:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm background Pq none
Name of the background.
For an output of W by H pixels the file
.Pa /usr/share/akture/backgrounds/ Ns Ar name Ns - Ns Ar W Ns x Ns Ar H Ns .akbg
is used, see
.Xr akture-conv 1 .
Outputs without a matching file use
.Cm background_color ,
and their resolution is added to
.Pa /var/db/akture/resolutions .
.It Cm background_color Pq #1E1410
Colour of outputs without a background picture.
.It Cm accent Pq #C8441B
Colour of the submit button and the logo mark.
.It Cm text_color Pq #F5EFE4
Colour of the text.
.It Cm font_ui Pq Pa /usr/share/akture/fonts/Outfit.ttf
Font file for the interface.
Variable fonts with a weight axis are used at several weights.
.It Cm font_clock Pq Pa /usr/share/akture/fonts/ZenKakuGothicNew-Light.ttf
Font file for the clock and the date; also used for characters
.Cm font_ui
lacks, such as Japanese.
.It Cm clock_format Pq %H:%M
.Xr strftime 3
format of the clock.
.It Cm show_logo Pq yes
Whether to show the logo in the lower right corner.
.It Cm logo Pq the system name
Text of the logo.
Text between
.Ql **
is bold, e.g.\&
.Ql **Autumn**BSD .
.It Cm scale Pq 1
Scale factor of the interface: 1, 1.25, 1.5 or 2.
.It Cm keyboard_layouts Pq none
Comma separated xkb layouts to switch between, e.g.\&
.Ql jp,us .
Without it the layouts of the X server are used.
.It Cm default_session Pq the first
File name or name of the session selected at first.
.It Cm remember_user Pq yes
Whether to preselect the user who logged in last.
.It Cm allow_power Pq yes
Whether shutting down and rebooting from the login screen is allowed.
.It Cm autologin_user Pq none
User logged in at boot without authentication, through the PAM
service
.Dq akture-autologin .
.It Cm x_server Pq Pa /usr/X11R7/bin/X
Path of the X server.
.It Cm x_args Pq -nolisten tcp
Further arguments of the X server, split at blanks.
.It Cm prefer_xsession Pq no
Run
.Pa ~/.xsession
instead of the selected session if the user has one.
.El
.Ss Session files
Each file in
.Pa /etc/akture/sessions
describes one session in the same syntax:
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Cm name
The name shown on the login screen.
.It Cm exec
Absolute path of the command and its arguments, split at blanks and
run without a shell.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "/etc/akture/akture.conf" -compact
.It Pa /etc/akture/akture.conf
.It Pa /etc/akture/sessions/
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
background = autumn
keyboard_layouts = jp,us
logo = **Autumn**BSD
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr akture-conv 1 ,
.Xr akture 8
